Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- "Ratenkauf" next to "Behörde bezahlen": net invoice amount, VAT %, first payment
  date, optional down payment, monthly instalments (0 = book each payment by hand),
  with a live preview of the first payment and the instalments.
- First payment = down payment (or first instalment) net + the whole VAT; all
  later payments are net only. Every payment is a normal expense (planId), so the
  month, UVA and accountant package see the right Netto/VAT.
- Monthly instalments book themselves when due (with the existing instalment
  check); last one takes the rounding rest. Extra payments and Stop per plan.
- state.purchasePlans saved/loaded/backed up/cleared like the other lists.
- CHANGES_FOR_BACKEND.md: step 5.

